{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e13-scene-06",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "去扫描一下交给闻思默老师  (Scan This and Hand It to Wen Simo)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "stella": "斯戴拉",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back at Xingtian, the foreign group's representative demands Chun Yuqiao be replaced with Wang Er as a condition of partnership. Refusing to disturb Yuqiao, Stella and Kaiwen stall him and search paper archives for proof of Wang Er's sabotage. Listen to Kaiwen, Stella, and Xiaogu in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "没有人可以干扰首席内容官的工作日程，他必然有他要做的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "王尔就是这次侵权事件的始作俑者，我担心您相信错误的人了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "那就请你们在这儿等我们的回复吧，花点时间你会得到答案的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "上次我请你给我二十四小时你都不愿意，这次请你等几个小时，算公平吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "别去打扰他，这事我们自己解决。你说是王尔动的手脚，有证据吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "王尔实在是太狡猾了，他趁着我们去年系统升级的时候钻了这个空子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他一手把真的合同递到了法务，一手把假的授权列表备案到我们版权库里头。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "去年十月二十号的一个会议流程，系统无记录，你有办法查出来吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "平时最痛恨的就是你的官僚作风，今天你真是立大功了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "钟阳子授权了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我一进公司就听人说那边的人来开会，我想把这个送上去，或许有帮助！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "干得漂亮！不过这个不要送到会议室，去扫描一下，交给闻思默老师！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "没有人可以干扰首席内容官的工作日程，他必然有他要做的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nobody interferes with our chief content officer's schedule — he certainly has vital work of his own to handle.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "王尔就是这次侵权事件的始作俑者，我担心您相信错误的人了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wang Er is the very culprit who engineered this infringement trap; I'm afraid you have trusted the wrong man.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "那就请你们在这儿等我们的回复吧，花点时间你会得到答案的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then please wait right here for our formal reply — give us a little time and you will have your answer.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "上次我请你给我二十四小时你都不愿意，这次请你等几个小时，算公平吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Last time you refused to grant me twenty-four hours; asking you to wait a few hours today is only fair, isn't it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "别去打扰他，这事我们自己解决。你说是王尔动的手脚，有证据吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Don't disturb Yuqiao — we'll solve this ourselves. You say Wang Er tampered with the files, so do we have proof?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "王尔实在是太狡猾了，他趁着我们去年系统升级的时候钻了这个空子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wang Er was remarkably cunning; he exploited a gap during our internal system upgrade last autumn.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他一手把真的合同递到了法务，一手把假的授权列表备案到我们版权库里头。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With one hand he sent the real contract to legal, and with the other he logged a fake song list into our copyright database.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "去年十月二十号的一个会议流程，系统无记录，你有办法查出来吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There's an October twentieth workflow from last year missing from the digital system — can you dig it up?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "平时最痛恨的就是你的官僚作风，今天你真是立大功了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Normally I can't stand your bureaucratic paper slips, yet today your habit saved the company!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "钟阳子授权了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Zhong Yangzi signed the authorization!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我一进公司就听人说那边的人来开会，我想把这个送上去，或许有帮助！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The moment I walked in, I heard they were meeting upstairs, so I rushed to bring this up in case it helps!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "干得漂亮！不过这个不要送到会议室，去扫描一下，交给闻思默老师！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Brilliant work! Don't take this into the conference room, though — scan a copy and send it straight to Mr Wen Simo!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "没有人可以干扰首席内容官的工作日程，他必然有他要做的事。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "王尔就是这次侵权事件的始作俑者，我担心您相信错误的人了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "那就请你们在这儿等我们的回复吧，花点时间你会得到答案的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "上次我请你给我二十四小时你都不愿意，这次请你等几个小时，算公平吧？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "别去打扰他，这事我们自己解决。你说是王尔动的手脚，有证据吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "王尔实在是太狡猾了，他趁着我们去年系统升级的时候钻了这个空子。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他一手把真的合同递到了法务，一手把假的授权列表备案到我们版权库里头。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "去年十月二十号的一个会议流程，系统无记录，你有办法查出来吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "平时最痛恨的就是你的官僚作风，今天你真是立大功了！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "钟阳子授权了！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我一进公司就听人说那边的人来开会，我想把这个送上去，或许有帮助！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "干得漂亮！不过这个不要送到会议室，去扫描一下，交给闻思默老师！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "With Wang Er's handwritten filing slip unearthed from HR's paper slips and Xiaogu arriving right on cue with the songwriter's signed authorization, Stella sends the counterstrike straight to Wen Simo's studio! See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
